     4	
     5	# Full Stack FastAPI Template — Knowledge Bundle
     6	
     7	This is an [Open Knowledge Format](https://github.com/GoogleCloudPlatform/open-knowledge-format)
     8	v0.2 bundle: plain markdown files with YAML frontmatter, cross-linked like a small
     9	knowledge graph. Each concept file's `type` field says what kind of thing it documents.
    10	Only this root `index.md` carries frontmatter beyond a concept doc's own — and only
    11	the reserved `okf_version` key, per spec.
    12	
    13	## Trust tier
    14	
    15	Every concept doc in this bundle carries `generated: { by: reference_agent/claude-sonnet-5,
    16	at: ... }` and a `sources` entry pointing at the real source file it describes, but
